            }
          },
          {
            "id": "2114366270816612471",
            "text": "Ah que isso kkkkkkkk",
            "author_username": "nikolas_dm",
            "author_name": "nikolas_dm",
            "created_at": "2026-10-25T14:39:00+00:00",
            "permalink": "https://nitter.meowing.monster/nikolas_dm/status/2114366270816612471#m",
            "metrics": {
              "like_count": 50,
              "reply_count": 37,
              "retweet_count": 109,
              "quote_count": 3
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "2114361595300078063",
            "text": "Dito isso… 🇧🇷",
            "author_username": "nikolas_dm",
            "author_name": "nikolas_dm",
            "created_at": "2026-10-25T14:21:00+00:00",
            "permalink": "https://nitter.meowing.monster/nikolas_dm/status/2114361595300078063#m",
            "metrics": {
              "like_count": 372,
              "reply_count": 748,
              "retweet_count": 5,
              "quote_count": 67
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "2114182251189768541",
            "text": "“Dê o primeiro passo com fé. Você não precisa ver a escada inteira, apenas o primeiro degrau.”\n\n25.01.26 - Acorda Brasil.",
            "author_username": "nikolas_dm",
            "author_name": "nikolas_dm",
            "created_at": "2026-10-25T02:28:00+00:00",
            "permalink": "https://nitter.meowing.monster/nikolas_dm/status/2114182251189768541#m",
            "metrics": {
              "like_count": 200,
              "reply_count": 323,
              "retweet_count": 3,
              "quote_count": 21
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "2114152668218249686",
            "text": "Faremos justiça amanhã, presidente. Obrigado por ter criado um Brasil antes e depois de você.",
            "author_username": "nikolas_dm",
            "author_name": "nikolas_dm",
            "created_at": "2026-10-25T00:30:00+00:00",
            "permalink": "https://nitter.meowing.monster/nikolas_dm/status/2114152668218249686#m",
            "metrics": {
              "like_count": 912,
              "reply_count": 3,
              "retweet_count": 14,
              "quote_count": 95
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "2114137629210067451",
            "text": "Fiz tudo que pude. \nAgora está em suas mãos, Senhor.",
            "author_username": "nikolas_dm",
            "author_name": "nikolas_dm",
            "created_at": "2026-10-24T23:31:00+00:00",
            "permalink": "https://nitter.meowing.monster/nikolas_dm/status/2114137629210067451#m",
            "metrics": {
              "like_count": 1,
              "reply_count": 7,
              "retweet_count": 21,
              "quote_count": 157
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "2114129478951506216",
            "text": "69 dias. 80 cidades. E você cuidando da nossa casa enquanto isso. Obrigado, amor... te amo até o céu 💛",
            "author_username": "nikolas_dm",
            "author_name": "nikolas_dm",
            "created_at": "2026-10-24T22:58:00+00:00",
            "permalink": "https://nitter.meowing.monster/nikolas_dm/status/2114129478951506216#m",
            "metrics": {
              "like_count": 533,
              "reply_count": 928,
              "retweet_count": 6,
              "quote_count": 73
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "2114126027936915956",
            "text": "Se precisar a gente escala também. 😂\n\nMuito obrigado, Rio de Janeiro!",
            "author_username": "nikolas_dm",
            "author_name": "nikolas_dm",
            "created_at": "2026-10-24T22:44:00+00:00",
            "permalink": "https://nitter.meowing.monster/nikolas_dm/status/2114126027936915956#m",
